IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhousto
 n.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/03/New-Leala.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/wp-content/upload
 s/2024/03/New-Leala.jpg
UID:_-oIFr4TOCaDd084DeQeP
SUMMARY:Texas Sound Meditation with Leala\, Melissa\, and James
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260818T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Levy Park brings “Self Care” to a whole new level with Sound He
	aling led by Leala\, Melissa\, and James. \nA sound bath is a gentle\, nur
	turing\, and cathartic meditation experience for anyone looking to improve
	 the quality of their life. This act of self-care is beneficial for anyone
	 from beginners to advanced meditators who are ready to experience a great
	er sense of peace and well-being. \nThe Levy Park Sound Baths will assist 
	in clearing out that which is blocking the natural vitality while strength
	ening the connection and balance between mind\, body\, and soul. A collect
	ively cultivated safe space offers participants an opportunity to deepen t
	heir own journey of self-love\, healing or transformation. \nWhile relievi
	ng stress\, tension and anxiety this sound immersion experience will have 
	you feeling revitalized\, relaxed and rejuvenate. Let the sounds wash away
	 everything that no longer serves you as you set your intentions and manif
	est your desires! \n \n\nhttps://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/sound-ther
	apy-texas-sound/2026-08-18/\n\nFrom Levy Park Houston
URL:https://www.levyparkhouston.org/events/sound-therapy-texas-sound/2026-0
	8-18/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:levy-park-houston
CATEGORIES:Levy Park Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
IMAGE;VALUE=URI;DISPLAY=BADGE;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston
 .com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://365thingsinhouston.com/wp-content/uploads
 /2026/07/The-Girl-on-the-Train-at-Alley-Theatre.jpg
UID:jMrvfrM0ED_jZHljf9Ido
SUMMARY:The Girl on the Train at Alley Theatre
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260818T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Alley Theatre presents The Girl on the Train\, the 2026 product
	ion in Alley’s annual Summer Chills series\, live on stage in Downtown. \n
	The modern psychological thriller\, adapted from the best-selling novel an
	d hit film\, follows Rachel\, a woman struggling with dependency. \nShe mu
	st piece together her fragmented memories to find a girl who’s gone missin
	g. As her night comes back to her\, she considers\, “Who can you trust whe
	n you can’t trust yourself?” \nAdmission\nTickets start at $32. Order tick
	ets or learn more. \n \nThis Featured Calendar Listing was sponsored by th
	e event organizer and boosted in our calendar with images and more details
	. \nLearn more about promoting your event\, organization\, business\, or o
	ffer across all of our channels. \n\nhttps://365thingsinhouston.com/calend
	ar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-theatre-29/\n\nFrom 365 Things to Do in 
	Houston
URL:https://365thingsinhouston.com/calendar/the-girl-on-the-train-at-alley-
	theatre-29/
LOCATION:Alley Theatre\, 615 Texas St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002\, United State
	s
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:365-things-houston
CATEGORIES:365 Things to Do in Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT1H
