SUMMARY:Industrious Coworking Day: Summer Series
DTSTAMP:20260815T032440Z
DTSTART:20260827T083000Z
DESCRIPTION:Register here: https://luma.com/c1h8xq1m \n​Summer Co-Working D
	ay at Industrious \n​Join us at Industrious on August 27th from 8:00 AM – 
	5:00 PM for a full day of productivity\, connection\, and community. Exper
	ience what it’s like to work from our vibrant workspace with complimentary
	 coworking for the day\, high-speed WiFi\, and opportunities to meet other
	 professionals in the building. \n​We’ll kick off the morning with breakfa
	st\, followed by specialty snacks from a featured caterer\, and plenty of 
	opportunities for networking throughout the day. Our team will also be off
	ering guided tours of the space and sharing upcoming programming and event
	s happening in the community. \n​To wrap up the day\, join us for a happy 
	hour from 4:00 – 5:00 PM — drinks are on us as we continue the conversatio
	n and celebrate the Industrious community. \n​What to expect: \n​Complimen
	tary coworking from 8:00 AM – 5:00 PM \n​Breakfast to start your day \n​Sp
	ecialty snacks from a guest caterer \n​Networking opportunities with membe
	rs and guests \n​Free high-speed WiFi \n​Workspace tours and insights into
	 upcoming programming \n​Happy Hour (4:00 – 5:00 PM) — drinks on us \n​Par
	king:\nParking is free for the first 3 hours\, then $10 for the remainder 
	of the day. \n​Come work\, connect\, and experience a day in the life at I
	ndustrious. We look forward to welcoming you!\n\nhttps://iondistrict.com/e
	vent/industrious-coworking-day-summer-series-2/\n\nFrom Ion District
URL:https://iondistrict.com/event/industrious-coworking-day-summer-series-2
	/
LOCATION:Industrious\, 4201 Main St\, Houston\, TX\, 77002
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ion-district
CATEGORIES:Ion District
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT9H
END:VEVENT
