SUMMARY:National Voter Registration Day
DTSTAMP:20260815T032441Z
DTSTART:20260915T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:Did you know that on Tuesday\, September 15th\, it’s National V
	oter Registration Day! \nAt Houston Food Bank\, we care about having your 
	voice heard\, and we are proud to provide the opportunity for you to regis
	ter to vote on National Voter Registration Day! \nWe are partnering with H
	arris County Tax Office and the National Voter Registration Day organizati
	on to serve as a site for Voter Registration at our Portwall location. \nY
	ou are eligible to register to vote if: \n\nYou are a United States citize
	n\;\nYou are a resident of the county where you submit the application\;\n
	You are at least 17 years and 10 months old on the date your voter registr
	ation application is submitted\, and you are 18 years of age on Election D
	ay.\nYou are not a convicted felon (you may be eligible to vote if you hav
	e completed your sentence\, probation\, and parole)\; and\nYou have not be
	en declared by a court exercising probate jurisdiction to be either totall
	y mentally incapacitated or partially mentally incapacitated without the r
	ight to vote.\n\nLearn More\n\nhttps://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingeve
	nt/national-voter-registration-day-3/\n\nFrom Houston Food Bank
URL:https://www.houstonfoodbank.org/upcomingevent/national-voter-registrati
	on-day-3/
LOCATION:Houston Food Bank East Branch\, 535 Portwall Street\, Houston\, TX
	\, 77029\, United States
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:houston-food-bank
CATEGORIES:Houston Food Bank
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT24H
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
