SUMMARY:Hunger Action Day
DTSTAMP:20260815T032441Z
DTSTART:20260929T000000Z
DESCRIPTION:September 29th is Hunger Action Day. \nTo mark the occasion\, y
	ou can make a contribution to Houston Food Bank’s efforts to alleviate hun
	ger\, learn how your voice can make a difference to those experiencing foo
	d insecurity\, or even give your time to help your neighbors in need. \nTo
	gether we can work towards a world without food insecurity.\n\nhttps://www
