DTSTAMP:20260815T032441Z
DTSTART:20261002T150000Z
DESCRIPTION:Houston TCG Con XII – Find It. Trade It. Collect It.\nIf you’ve
	 been sitting on trade bait\, chasing a grail\, or just need to restock st
	aples before the next format shift\, this is your weekend. Houston TCG Con
	 XII is three days of curated buying\, selling\, and trading across every 
	major game – the vendors across the table are collectors just like you\, a
	nd they’re buying out of your binder while you shop theirs. \n  \n📅 Friday
	\, October 2 to Sunday\, October 4\, 2026\n⏰ Friday 3PM – 10PM | Saturday 
	10AM – 5PM | Sunday 10AM – 5PM\n📍 9700 Bissonnet St\, Unit 1500\, Houston\
	, TX\n🎟️ FREE Entry + FREE Parking \n  \n🔥 Event Highlights 🔥\n🃏 Dozens of 
	Vendor Tables – One Curated Floor\nForget the rows of random tables. Houst
	on TCG Con XII brings together vendors with serious depth across Pokémon\,
	 Yu-Gi-Oh!\, MTG\, One Piece\, Lorcana\, Riftbound\, Flesh and Blood\, Dra
	gon Ball Super\, Digimon\, and more. Different games\, different collectio
	ns\, one very busy floor. \n  \n🤝 Buy • Sell • Trade — All Weekend\nThis i
	s a buy-sell-trade floor\, not a one-way shopping trip. The vendors here a
	re collectors first. \n  \n🔍 On-Site Grading Submissions & Card Restoratio
	ns — Cappy’s Cards!\nHave a card you’ve been thinking about grading? Or on
	e that needs a little restoration? Cappy’s Cards will be on-site helping c
	ollectors with grading submissions\, restoration services\, and expert ins
	ight all weekend. \n  \n💼 Interested in Vending?\nIf you’ve got singles\, 
	sealed product\, graded slabs\, TCG accessories\, or anything else the Hou
	ston community is hunting this Labor Day weekend\, apply here → https://ti
	nyurl.com/HoustonTCGCon \n  \n🏨 Staying the Weekend?\nThree days is worth 
	the trip. Book your stay: Here \n  \nYour binder has three days of work ah
	ead of it. Lots of Pokémon\, MTG\, One Piece\, Yu-Gi-Oh!\, and more give y
	ou plenty to dig through\, trade around\, and bring home at Houston TCG Co
	n XII.\n\nhttps://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xii/\n\nFrom CCS 
	Houston
URL:https://ccs-houston.com/events/houston-tcg-con-xii/
X-CALRIPPER-SOURCE:ccs-houston
CATEGORIES:CCS Houston
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DURATION:PT50H
END:VEVENT
